{"tier":"glm-5.3-flash","verse":7,"ref":"genesis 43:7","book":"genesis","lang":"en4","chapter":43,"translation":"And they said, Asking he asked — the man asked of us and of our kindred, saying, Is your father yet alive? Is there a brother to you? And we told him upon the mouth of these words. Knowing, could we know that he would say, Bring down ⟨את⟩ your brother?","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמרו","gloss":"And they said"},{"surface":"שאול","gloss":"Asking"},{"surface":"שאל","gloss":"he asked"},{"surface":"האיש","gloss":"the man"},{"surface":"לנו","gloss":"of us"},{"surface":"ולמולדתנו","gloss":"and of our kindred"},{"surface":"לאמר","gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"העוד","gloss":"Is… yet"},{"surface":"אביכם","gloss":"your father"},{"surface":"חי","gloss":"alive"},{"surface":"היש","gloss":"Is there"},{"surface":"לכם","gloss":"to you"},{"surface":"אח","gloss":"a brother"},{"surface":"ונגד","gloss":"And we told"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"him"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"upon"},{"surface":"פי","gloss":"the mouth of"},{"surface":"הדברים","gloss":"the words"},{"surface":"האלה","gloss":"these"},{"surface":"הידוע","gloss":"Knowing"},{"surface":"נדע","gloss":"could we know"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"יאמר","gloss":"he would say"},{"surface":"הורידו","gloss":"Bring down"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"your brother"},{"surface":"אחיכם","gloss":"your brother"}],"timestamp":"2026-09-20T12:25:03.815674467Z","model":"glm-5.3-flash"}